Subject: [PATCH] 2D-RoPE option for the ViT encoder (pos_enc=rope2d), seeding,
 final.ckpt, swa_base_lr, JSON eval

For the 2D-RoPE-STR IJDAR revision (E5): replace the learned additive position
embedding with axial 2D-RoPE (equal split, base 10000, learnable per-axis
scales) in every encoder block; everything else unchanged.

